    "distinct_from_recent": "Nov 21 drew a tracked rover on rubble, a staged town, brass plate stacks and a data rail. Nov 20 drew a survey quad on a ridge and a clay tablet. Nov 19 drew sort glass and flies. None drew a cutaway pair of rooms, a stethoscope wall, a switch relief, a timing rail, annotated slips, handoff trays or exam paper rolls."
